    "tagLine": " Discover a bold new way of urban living !",
    "location": "The Location: Dublin 8’s Creative Core\r\n\r\n18 Newmarket Square sits in the heart of The Liberties, recently named one of the world’s coolest neighbourhoods. Steeped in history yet buzzing with creativity, this is Dublin at its most authentic.\r\n\r\nOn your doorstep are cultural icons like the Guinness Storehouse, St. Patrick’s Cathedral, and Christ Church Cathedral, alongside modern hotspots such as Teeling Whiskey Distillery, Hen’s Teeth, and Michelin-starred Variety Jones. Local favourites like The Fumbally, Two Pups Coffee, and Lucky’s add to the neighbourhood’s laid-back, eclectic charm.\r\n\r\nThe area is also home to major institutions, including Diageo, St. James’s Hospital, the National College of Art & Design, and the Guinness Enterprise Centre, making it a hub for innovation, learning, and opportunity.\r\n\r\nWith the city centre minutes away and excellent Luas and cycling connections, 18 Newmarket Square places you at the centre of culture, community, and convenience"
