  "description": "Discover a bold new way of urban living at 18 Newmarket Square, right in the heart of The Liberties – recently named one of the world’s coolest neighbourhoods. Here, history meets modernity, charm blends with convenience, and community thrives. \n\nGet ready to make new friends, create unforgettable memories, and live your best life! Newmarket Square guarantees you the lifestyle upgrade you deserve!\n\n18 Newmarket Square boasts a host first-class amenities for a lifestyle of comfort:\n\n\tGym & wellness centre, free and exclusively for residents,\n      Landscaped rooftop terraces with panoramic views of the city and Dublin mountains to \n        unwind, away from the nearby buzz of the city,\n\tShared co -working space to ease the flexibility of working remotely,\n\tReception Lounge \n\tCinema room to help you relax away from the bustle of the city,\n\tSeamless high-speed Wi-Fi connectivity,\n\tGames room with a variety of entertainment options for residents,\n\tBike storage rooms,\n\tGames room with a variety of entertainment options for resident.\n\nYou can explore the city  from our prime location and you are guaranteed to find:\n\n\tNeighbourhood distilleries, restaurants, cafes, and artist studios, \n\tTrendy shops and landmarks plus live music venues,\n\tExcellent public transport links - Numerous bus stops and Luas stop on your doorstep, \n\tShort walk to Christ Church Cathedral, Guinness Storehouse and St. Stephen's Green.\n\nAll apartments consist of:\n\n\tSpacious, light-filled space\n       Stylish fully furnished, bespoke interior design\n\tA-rated development, energy efficient apartments\n\tPrivate balconies with stunning Dublin mountains and city views,\n\tModern and contemporary apartments reaching the 9th floor,\n\tOpen-plan kitchen, living, and dining area,\n\tBuilt-in wardrobes and ample storage,\n\tMain bathroom, en-suite bathroom in the main bedroom, \n\tHigh-quality fixtures and finishes,\n\nWith a variety of apartment types and layouts available. Contact a member of our team today to arrange a viewing and see for yourself what 18 Newmarket Square has to offer.\n\nLive the Dublin dream: Book your viewing today!",
